        "PMC9260516::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC9260516::web::004::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Alloying Co, Cu, and Ni with Pt and Pd produces isolated Pt and Pd active sites.",
